<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53413" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπ-ίζω</span></b>  (A), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπός</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enjoy the
				fruits of,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(5).243
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Paros</span>):— elsewh. always in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theopomp.Hist.
					217b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῆρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFrankf.</u>
					7.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				5.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).419.14
			</span></i> (Phigalea, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.413.28
			</span></i>, al. (Oropus, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					3p.61U.
				</span></i>
			; but also, <i>exhaust</i> the soil, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπίζεται τὴν γῆν μάλιστα πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					8.9.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				4.8.1
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαν ἐσθλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					432
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦδος ἐκαρπίσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					516.4
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Aegae</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				3.781
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>); <i>exploit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1571
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλτιον
			ἐμὲ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν σοφίαν</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> καρπίζεσθαι ὑπὲρ Χρυσίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Pr.</u>
					8.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make fruitful, fertilize</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				408
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1328
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
